      "x-23cb2d58ca9345cc: control · workload default → all assertions passed"
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "The rule-validator field_count=21 check appeared lenient and did not catch the input slot mismatch; the exact criteria of that check was not fully inspected",
      "No experiment tested a partial-field mitigation; only the full 2-field and full-20-field scenarios were observed"
    ],
    "mitigation": {
      "text": "Add the remaining 18 input fields to rule-0291's criteria so that all 20 required inputs are supplied, or adjust template T7's inputs_supplied contract to match the 2 fields provided by rule-0291",
